{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PLATFORM 0 -\u00a0is a first-person horror experience focused on tension, stealth, and environmental storytelling. You play as a lone survivor trapped in a massive underground metro system haunted by a mysterious ghost train.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082350/extras/bc5df489a143511b7c8c7360bd753818.poster.avif?t=1760088812\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082350/extras/bc5df489a143511b7c8c7360bd753818.webm?t=1760088812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no weapons. Your main tools are silence, awareness, and the environment itself.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u00a0Key Gameplay Elements:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration:</strong> Navigate abandoned stations, dark tunnels, and derelict utility rooms in search of a way out.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082350/extras/cc12b7a89bad42c81dd121976f80c5b5.poster.avif?t=1760088812\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082350/extras/cc12b7a89bad42c81dd121976f80c5b5.webm?t=1760088812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082350/extras/cc12b7a89bad42c81dd121976f80c5b5.mp4?t=1760088812\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stealth Survival:</strong> Make too much noise, and the ghost train will find you. Crouch, hide, and listen carefully to survive.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082350/extras/0f13021d848b4e38226f88815ea1cff5.poster.avif?t=1760088812\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082350/extras/0f13021d848b4e38226f88815ea1cff5.webm?t=1760088812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082350/extras/0f13021d848b4e38226f88815ea1cff5.mp4?t=1760088812\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Traps &amp; Scare Points:</strong> Some areas offer light and supplies. Others are bait for terrifying ambushes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interactive Items:</strong> Use tools to unlock new paths, solve simple environmental puzzles, or distract threats.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082350/extras/c1b674a648d35c01ef680042ee799f11.poster.avif?t=1760088812\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082350/extras/c1b674a648d35c01ef680042ee799f11.webm?t=1760088812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082350/extras/c1b674a648d35c01ef680042ee799f11.mp4?t=1760088812\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Threat:</strong> The ghost train isn\u2019t bound to a single track \u2014 it roams. It hears. It hunts.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not a shooter. It\u2019s a horror game where survival comes from being quiet, thinking fast, and paying attention to every sound in the darkness.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4082350?t=1760088812","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.