/cc12b7a89bad42c81dd121976f80c5b5.poster.avif?t=1760088812\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082350/extras/cc12b7a89bad42c81dd121976f80c5b5.webm?t=1760088812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082350/extras/cc12b7a89bad42c81dd121976f80c5b5.mp4?t=1760088812\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stealth Survival:</strong> Make too much noise, and the ghost train will find you. Crouch, hide, and listen carefully to survive.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082350/extras/0f13021d848b4e38226f88815ea1cff5.poster.avif?t=1760088812\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082350/extras/0f13021d848b4e38226f88815ea1cff5.webm?t=1760088812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082350/extras/0f13021d848b4e38226f88815ea1cff5.mp4?t=1760088812\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Traps &amp; Scare Points:</strong> Some areas offer light and supplies. Others are bait for terrifying ambushes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interactive Items:</strong> Use tools to unlock new paths, solve simple environmental puzzles, or distract threats.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082350/extras/c1b674a648d35c01ef680042ee799f11.poster.avif?t=1760088812\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082350/extras/c1b674a648d35c01ef680042ee799f11.webm?t=1760088812\" type=\"video/webm; cod